      "snippet_id": "SNP-001",
      "snippet_text": "\"With Share & Save, you can save on Etsy fees when you drive your own traffic to your shop and listings. Once you enroll in Share & Save, if a buyer places an order within 30 days of clicking a link you've shared, you get an instant refund of 4% off the eligible order total from your Etsy Payment account balance.\"",
